---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy - Cóndor Expeditions"
	description="How we collect, use and protect your personal data at Cóndor Expeditions."
	lang="en"
>
	<section class="pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 bg-negro text-white">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-white/70">Last updated: August 2026</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding bg-background">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">1. Data we collect</h2>
				<p>We only collect the data needed to manage your booking: name, email address, phone number and basic participant information. We do not store credit card data on our systems.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">2. How we use your information</h2>
				<p>We use your data to confirm bookings, coordinate tour logistics and communicate with you before and during your experience. We never sell or share your information with third parties unrelated to the booked service.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">3. Your rights</h2>
				<p>Under Ecuador's Personal Data Protection Law, you may request access, correction or deletion of your data through our <a href="/en/contacto" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
				<p>This site uses only technical cookies required for it to work. We do not use advertising tracking cookies.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
